":"臼田裕次郎","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:169961","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"桐下 暁","creatorId":"vndb:s31572","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s31572","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s31572","name":"Sous le Paulownia","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:169963","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93758","characterName":"ルピナス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93758"},"originalCharacterName":"ルピナス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lupine is the female owner of the tavern where adventurers gather, a place known as \"The Stray Sheep\". Following her father's wishes, Lupine succeeded him as owner after his death."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes caring after others to the point of being a bit overbearing. This caring nature of hers has won the hearts of her neighbors, who love her dearly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lupine works hard every day to liven up the tavern left behind by her father, and fill it with adventurers, just like in the old days."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even the adventurers there are no match for her in strength when it comes to handling drunk and troublesome guests. She even has the power to send monsters flying. On the other hand, she is a catastrophe when it comes to cooking. Unfortunately, her cooking has caused guests to stay away..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93758"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36002fcd1b2b8f569e73f4d45e7e5bc110e3c2046ebe7c83524f06a4e24ec7ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca69cf54557d28b576